Third-party material in test/semantic
=====================================

The semantic test harness is part of ghidra-xstormy16 (GPL-3.0, see LICENSE). It
contains or builds against the following third-party code, all of it GPL-compatible
with GPL-3.0:

oracle/sid-shim/sid-hooks.inc
    h_pc_set_handler, h_gr_set_handler and parity() copied verbatim from SID
    (sid-20180601 snapshot, sid/component/cgen-cpu/xstormy16/xstormy16.h and
    xstormy16.cxx). Copyright (C) 1999, 2000, 2006 Red Hat. Part of SID, licensed under
    the GNU General Public License version 2 or (at your option) any later version; see
    COPYING.SID in the SID distribution.

oracle/fetch-sid.sh (not committed, fetched at build time)
    The CGEN-generated xstormy16-sem.cxx, xstormy16-decode.cxx and headers, and SID's
    cgen-ops.h, cgen-types.h and cgen-engine.h field macros, from
    https://sourceware.org/pub/sid/snapshots/sid-20180601.tar.bz2 (sha512 pinned in the
    script). Copyright Red Hat, GPLv2 or later as above.

oracle/cgen26/gen/*
    Generated by CGEN (https://sourceware.org/git/cgen.git, commit
    360079deda913ae36d1c9c985aa505bf0fd49af0) from binutils 2.45 cpu/xstormy16.cpu and
    cpu/simplify.inc. The generated files carry their own notice: Copyright (C)
    1996-2026 Free Software Foundation, Inc., GPL version 3 or later.

oracle/cgen26/sim/cgen-ops.h
    Copied unmodified from gdb 18.1, sim/common/cgen-ops.h (sha256
    f6f35cb657163f157c497bd05581cbddcbfe846f877401cc5dfd4ec7a4f95b8e).
    Copyright (C) 1996-2026 Free Software Foundation, Inc., GPL version 3 or later.

oracle/ub-guards.h
    The rotate definitions follow RORSI/ROLSI in gdb's sim/common/cgen-utils.c
    (Copyright Free Software Foundation, Inc., GPL version 3 or later).
